OL,3,AAlberta's decisive decision to stay in
OL,4,ACanada gives Carney backing to take on
OL,5,ATrump
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Vote like Canada depends on it," Prime
OL,8,FMinister Mark Carney declared to
OL,9,Fcheering crowds in Calgary last week on
OL,10,Fa stage emblazoned with bright red and
OL,11,Fwhite "Forever Canadian" banners.
OL,13,FIt's a message that appears to have
OL,14,Fstruck a chord with the electorate, as
OL,15,Fpreliminary results show more than
OL,16,Ftwo-thirds of Alberta voters said they
OL,17,Fwant to remain a part of Canada.
OL,19,FBut the future of the federation does
OL,20,Fstill rest on its richest province.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
