OL,3,AAlberta's decisive decision to stay in
OL,4,ACanada gives Carney backing to take on
OL,5,ATrump
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlberta, with most of Canada's proven
OL,8,Foil reserves and abundant gas and
OL,9,Fmineral wealth, is playing a pivotal
OL,10,Frole in Ottawa's drive to survive a
OL,11,Fpunishing trade war with the US by
OL,12,Fdiversifying trade, strengthening its
OL,13,Feconomy, and forging new alliances on
OL,14,Fthe other side of the world.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
